OL,3,GNEWSAHow a fan's dying wish led a Dutch
OL,4,Afootball team to a tartan kit
OL,5,
OL,6,FDennis Van Unen's dying wish was to
OL,7,Fexperience an Old Firm match in person.
OL,9,FThe FC Twente fan, who had terminal
OL,10,Fcancer, achieved that dream in 2006
OL,11,Fwith the help of two Stranraer
OL,12,Fsupporters.
OL,14,FWhat followed was an unlikely
OL,15,Ffriendship between fans of the Dutch
OL,16,Fclub and the Scottish town that has
OL,17,Fendured ever since.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
