OL,3,GNEWSAHow a fan's dying wish led a Dutch
OL,4,Afootball team to a tartan kit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThat bond has now been immortalised in
OL,7,Ffabric through a special
OL,8,Ftartan-inspired shirt, which will make
OL,9,Fits debut in FC Twente's Dutch
OL,10,FEredivisie match away to AZ Alkmaar
OL,11,Fthis weekend.
